  'guide.placement.title': 'Manage placement pathways',
  'guide.placement.why': 'Give every graduating athlete a consented bridge from academy progression to university, scholarship and professional opportunities, managed by a placement advisor with an auditable funnel, evidence checklist, reference requests and revocable institution sharing.',
  'guide.placement.s1': 'Open Academy, then Placement, and tap Add opportunity for an enrolled athlete.',
  'guide.placement.s2': 'Choose the type (university place, scholarship, grant or professional contract), set the institution, sport, deadline and intake year.',
  'guide.placement.s3': 'Build the evidence checklist: add items for academic transcript, sport CV, performance video, references and any passport or ranking documents.',
  'guide.placement.s4': 'Request references from coaches, academic coordinators or other referees and track their submission status.',
  'guide.placement.s5': 'Ask the athlete (or their guardian for under-18s) to grant the institution access to specific evidence fields. They choose exactly what to share and can revoke at any time.',
  'guide.placement.s6': 'Advance the opportunity through its stages — identified, eligibility check, evidence gathering, applied, offer received, outcome — as the process progresses.',
  'guide.placement.s7': 'Link a sponsorship award to the opportunity for attribution tracking across the finance module.',
  'guide.placement.s8': 'Use the Action Queue to triage urgent items: references due, missing evidence and pending guardian consents. Use Analytics for seasonal outcome and scholarship reports.',
