  'guide.officials_offline_pack.title': 'Match-day offline preparation',
  'guide.officials_offline_pack.why': 'Officials working in venues with poor signal can download the full match-day pack before kick-off and run clock, score, events, corrections and reports entirely offline.',
  'guide.officials_offline_pack.s1': 'Open Officials hub - Match-day pack. While online, tap Save my games for offline to download the full referee pack for every upcoming fixture.',
  'guide.officials_offline_pack.s2': 'All clock, score, match-event, correction and report ops flow through the referee queue, encrypted on-device.',
  'guide.officials_offline_pack.s3': 'An Offline banner appears when signal drops; all ops continue locally and queue durably.',
  'guide.officials_offline_pack.s4': 'On reconnect the queue auto-flushes idempotently; duplicates are silently acked.',
  'guide.officials_offline_pack.s5': 'Conflicts are surfaced in the Offline sync screen for one-by-one resolution (Accept or Discard).',
  'guide.officials_offline_pack.s6': 'The Offline sync screen shows status, queued ops, conflicts, clock-drift and full op-audit history.',
  'guide.officials_offline_pack.s7': 'Sign-out flushes the queue then erases all encrypted data from the device.',
