  'guide.sponsorship_contracts.title': 'Sponsorship contracts & e-signatures',
  'guide.sponsorship_contracts.why': 'Turn a sponsorship agreement into a legally admissible contract with a branded PDF, named signatories, e-signature (GotMyGame, DocuSign or Adobe Sign), signing deadline, auto-reminders, and a downloadable completion certificate.',
  'guide.sponsorship_contracts.step1': 'Open a sponsorship agreement, scroll to the Contract section, and tap Issue draft contract. The platform freezes the exact terms into a SHA-256-fingerprinted PDF.',
  'guide.sponsorship_contracts.step2': 'Tap Name signatories and choose who must sign for each side.',
  'guide.sponsorship_contracts.step3': 'Tap Send for signature: choose GotMyGame (simple), DocuSign or Adobe Sign (advanced), set signing order, deadline and auto-reminder days.',
  'guide.sponsorship_contracts.step4': 'Each signatory is notified. Use the metric strip (Signed N/N, Pending, Days Left) and Remind all to track progress.',
  'guide.sponsorship_contracts.step5': 'Once everyone signs, an immutable signed PDF is generated. Open Audit trail for a full event log.',
  'guide.sponsorship_contracts.step6': 'Tap Certificate to download the signed completion certificate PDF, suitable for tax authorities, federations or funders.',
